			<heading>
				The Way of Wisdom
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">she has hewn her<crossref let="w" cid="c20009001.2" />seven<crossref let="x" cid="c20009001.3" />pillars .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">she has also<crossref let="a" cid="c20009002.1" />set her table .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">from<crossref let="d" cid="c20009003.3" />the highest places in the town ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">
				<crossref let="f" cid="c20009004.2" />To him who lacks sense she says ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">and<crossref let="h" cid="c20009005.2" />drink of<crossref let="z" cid="c20009005.3" />the wine I have mixed .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">
				<crossref let="k" cid="c20009006.3" />and walk in the way of insight . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">and he who reproves a wicked man incurs injury .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">
				<crossref let="m" cid="c20009008.2" />reprove a wise man , and he will love you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">teach a righteous man , and he will<crossref let="o" cid="c20009009.2" />increase in learning .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and<crossref let="q" cid="c20009010.2" />the knowledge of the Holy One is insight .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and years will be added to your life .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">if you scoff , you alone will bear it .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">she is seductive and<crossref let="v" cid="c20009013.3" />knows nothing .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">she takes a seat on<crossref let="w" cid="c20009014.1" />the highest places of the town ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">who are<crossref let="x" cid="c20009015.1" />going straight on their way ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">And to him who lacks sense she says ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">and<crossref let="a" cid="c20009017.1" />bread eaten in secret is pleasant . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">that her guests are in the depths of Sheol .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20009019">
			</marker>
